Description: Abseil per_thread_sem_test_common library
URL: https://abseil.io/
Version: 20260107
Requires: absl_synchronization = 20260107, absl_base = 20260107, absl_config = 20260107, absl_strings = 20260107, absl_time = 20260107
Libs: -L${libdir}  -labsl_per_thread_sem_test_common 
Cflags: -I${includedir} -DNOMINMAX
